saves/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root-level capture/probe debris (oracle workflows dump savestates, WRAM/VRAM/
# OAM captures, framebuffer dumps and probe text into the repo ROOT).
# All patterns are ROOT-ANCHORED (leading /) so files in subdirectories are NOT
# hidden. NOTE on tracked files (gitignore never affects already-tracked files):
#   tools/_*.py probes that are tracked stay tracked despite tools/_*.
/*.state
/*.bin
/*.oam
/*.vram
/*.raw
/*.png
/SHOT*
